00:16:41,090 --> 00:16:43,180
Advanced class student.

322
00:16:43,510 --> 00:16:45,100
What do they mean?

323
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:50,980
Could one of us here be 
harboring feelings for Mr. Hitoma?

324
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:53,900
Hey, wait. That can't be it.

325
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:56,610
What's the next thing it says?

326
